<title>UK: Westpac sets $500 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Westpac sets $500 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets and</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTPAC BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY	.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    21.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.84     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.84</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES	THE BOND IS CALLABLE FROM OCTOBER 1999</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
